{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26881","headline":"题梁国公主池亭 · 姚合","name":"题梁国公主池亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳池馆枕秦川，门鏁南山一带烟。\n素柰花开西子面，绿榆枝种沈郎钱。\n装帘玳瑁随风落，庭岸鵁鶄趁煖眠。\n寂寞空余歌舞地，玉箫惊起凤归天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}